{
  "apiVersion": "takosumi.com/v2.4",
  "kind": "Repository",
  "install": {
    "modules": {
      "deploy/opentofu/cloudflare": {
        "inputs": [
          {
            "name": "project_name",
            "source": { "kind": "capsule_name" },
            "role": "service_name",
            "type": "string",
            "format": "subdomain",
            "label": { "ja": "ワークスペース名", "en": "Workspace name" },
            "helper": {
              "ja": "Takosのサービスとクラウドリソースに使う名前です。",
              "en": "The name used for the Takos service and its cloud resources."
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "public_subdomain",
            "source": { "kind": "module_default" },
            "type": "string",
            "format": "subdomain",
            "label": { "ja": "公開サブドメイン", "en": "Public subdomain" },
            "advanced": true
          },
          {
            "name": "public_url",
            "source": { "kind": "user" },
            "type": "string",
            "format": "url",
            "required": true,
            "label": { "ja": "公開URL", "en": "Public URL" },
            "helper": {
              "ja": "Worker の正規 HTTPS 公開URLです。",
              "en": "The canonical HTTPS origin for this Worker."
            },
            "placeholder": "https://takos.example.com"
          },
          {
            "name": "environment",
            "source": { "kind": "user" },
            "type": "string",
            "label": { "ja": "実行環境", "en": "Environment" },
            "helper": {
              "ja": "production または staging を指定します。Cloudflare provider-gap bridge を使う場合、mode と完全一致する環境を選びます。",
              "en": "Use production or staging. When the Cloudflare provider-gap bridge is enabled, the environment must exactly match its mode."
            },
            "advanced": true
          },
          {
            "name": "runtime_secrets_provisioned",
            "source": { "kind": "user" },
            "type": "boolean",
            "required": false,
            "label": { "ja": "ランタイムシークレット設定済み", "en": "Runtime secrets provisioned" },
            "helper": {
              "ja": "ENCRYPTION_KEY、TAKOS_AGENT_START_TOKEN、TAKOS_INTERNAL_API_SECRET、PLATFORM_PRIVATE_KEY、PLATFORM_PUBLIC_KEY が対象 Worker に既に存在するときだけ true にします。module は値を保持せず inherit binding で引き継ぎます。初回 install は false のまま apply し、値を投入してから true で再 apply します。",
              "en": "Set to true only when ENCRYPTION_KEY, TAKOS_AGENT_START_TOKEN, TAKOS_INTERNAL_API_SECRET, PLATFORM_PRIVATE_KEY, and PLATFORM_PUBLIC_KEY already exist on the target Worker. The module holds no value and carries them forward with the inherit binding. Apply a first install with false, supply the values, then apply again with true."
            },
            "advanced": true
          },
          {
            "name": "cloudflare",
            "source": { "kind": "user" },
            "type": "json",
            "required": true,
            "label": { "ja": "Cloudflare デプロイ設定", "en": "Cloudflare deployment settings" },
            "helper": {
              "ja": "Cloudflare の account_id と、必要なら workers_subdomain を JSON で指定します。認証情報は Provider Connection から別に渡されます。",
              "en": "Provide the Cloudflare account_id and optional workers_subdomain as JSON. Credentials are delivered separately through a Provider Connection."
            },
            "placeholder": "{\"account_id\":\"...\",\"workers_subdomain\":\"...\"}",
            "advanced": true
          },
          {
            "name": "cloudflare_provider_gap_bridge_mode",
            "source": { "kind": "user" },
            "type": "string",
            "label": { "ja": "Cloudflare provider-gap bridge のモード", "en": "Cloudflare provider-gap bridge mode" },
            "helper": {
              "ja": "既定値は off です。staging は environment=staging の smoke 用、disposable-production は environment=production と明示的な確認文字列を伴う一回限りの本番相当 E2E 用です。off の通常 production では provider gap は補われず、bridge は Vectorize、Container、D1、container-enabled Durable Object の gap だけを補います。",
              "en": "The default is off. Use staging only with environment=staging for smoke inputs, or disposable-production only with environment=production and the explicit acknowledgement below for a one-shot production-equivalent E2E. With off, ordinary production leaves provider gaps unresolved; the bridge covers only the Vectorize, Container, D1, and container-enabled Durable Object gaps."
            },
            "placeholder": "off | staging | disposable-production",
            "advanced": true
          },
          {
            "name": "cloudflare_provider_gap_bridge_acknowledgement",
            "source": { "kind": "user" },
            "type": "string",
            "label": { "ja": "disposable-production の確認", "en": "Disposable-production acknowledgement" },
            "helper": {
              "ja": "environment=production の disposable-production を選ぶときだけ DISPOSABLE_PRODUCTION_ONE_SHOT を完全一致で入力します。off と staging では空欄にします。",
              "en": "When disposable-production with environment=production is selected, enter DISPOSABLE_PRODUCTION_ONE_SHOT exactly. Keep this empty for off and staging."
            },
            "placeholder": "DISPOSABLE_PRODUCTION_ONE_SHOT",
            "advanced": true
          },
          {
            "name": "container_image",
            "source": { "kind": "user" },
            "type": "string",
            "required": false,
            "label": { "ja": "Container イメージ", "en": "Container image" },
            "helper": {
              "ja": "provider-gap bridge を使う場合だけ、Docker Hub または同一 Cloudflare account の immutable digest を指定します。GHCR はサポート対象外です。",
              "en": "When the provider-gap bridge is enabled, provide an immutable Docker Hub digest or same-account Cloudflare registry digest. GHCR is unsupported."
            },
            "placeholder": "docker.io/example/agent@sha256:<64 hex>",
            "advanced": true
          }
        ],
        "requires": [
          {
            "kind": "secret.generated",
            "bytes": 32,
            "encoding": "hex",
            "deliver": { "bindings": { "value": "ENCRYPTION_KEY" } }
          },
          {
            "kind": "secret.generated",
            "bytes": 32,
            "encoding": "hex",
            "deliver": { "bindings": { "value": "TAKOS_AGENT_START_TOKEN" } }
          },
          {
            "kind": "secret.generated",
            "bytes": 32,
            "encoding": "hex",
            "deliver": { "bindings": { "value": "TAKOS_INTERNAL_API_SECRET" } }
          },
          {
            "kind": "http.endpoint",
            "deliver": {
              "variables": {
                "url": "public_url",
                "subdomain": "public_subdomain"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "kind": "identity.oidc",
            "callbackPath": "/auth/oidc/callback",
            "scopes": [
              "openid",
              "profile",
              "email",
              "offline_access",
              "capsules:read",
              "capsules:write"
            ],
            "deliver": {
              "variables": {
                "accountsUrl": "takosumi_accounts_url",
                "issuerUrl": "takosumi_accounts_issuer_url",
                "clientId": "takosumi_accounts_client_id",
                "redirectUri": "takosumi_accounts_redirect_uri"
              }
            }
          }
        ],
        "interfaces": [
          {
            "key": "launcher",
            "name": "takos.launcher",
            "spec": {
              "type": "interface.ui.surface",
              "version": "1",
              "document": {
                "launcher": true,
                "display": { "title": "Takos", "icon": "/logo.png" }
              },
              "inputs": {
                "url": { "source": "output", "outputName": "launch_url", "outputType": "url" }
              },
              "access": { "visibility": "workspace" }
            },
            "bindingRequests": [
              {
                "key": "installer",
                "subject": { "source": "installing_principal" },
                "permissions": ["ui.open"],
                "delivery": { "type": "none" }
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "sourceBuild": {
          "commands": [
            { "argv": ["bun", "install", "--frozen-lockfile"] },
            { "argv": ["bun", "run", "build:opentofu-worker-artifact"] }
          ],
          "outputs": [
            "deploy/opentofu/cloudflare/.takos-build/worker/index.js",
            "deploy/opentofu/cloudflare/.takos-build/assets",
            "deploy/opentofu/cloudflare/.takos-build/bridge/takos-cloudflare-opentofu-bridge.ts",
            "deploy/opentofu/cloudflare/.takos-build/container-desired.json",
            "deploy/opentofu/cloudflare/.takos-build/manifest.json"
          ]
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
